OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will start chilly with
OL,6,Fdense fog in the east, though brighter
OL,7,Fwith the odd coastal shower elsewhere.
OL,8,FThe fog will gradually lift, leaving a
OL,9,Fmostly dry day with sunny spells in
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Pleasant enough in the
OL,11,Flight winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will stay largely dry
OL,14,Fovernight. There will be clear spells.
OL,15,FHowever, fog and frost is likely to re-
OL,16,Fform in the east, whilst it turns
OL,17,Fcloudy and breezy further west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
