OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FFog and frost should clear
OL,6,Freadily in the east on Monday, leaving
OL,7,Fbright spells. However, expect a
OL,8,Fstrengthening easterly breeze, and
OL,9,Fpatchy rain could develop in the far
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith rain at times on Tuesday,
OL,14,Faccompanied by a southeasterly breeze.
OL,15,FFurther rain on Wednesday and for a
OL,16,Fwhile on Thursday, before turning
OL,17,Fclearer and colder later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
